# SupportAI – AI-Powered Smart Ticket Management System

An intelligent customer support and ticket management backend built using **Java, Spring Boot, Spring Security, MySQL, Docker, and Ollama AI**.

SupportAI helps manage customer support tickets through AI-powered classification, role-based access control, intelligent agent assignment, SLA monitoring, ticket history, notifications, and an AI chatbot.

---

## 1. Project Overview

SupportAI is a backend application designed to streamline customer support operations.

Customers can create and track support tickets, while agents and administrators can manage assignments, update ticket status, monitor SLA performance, and analyze support operations.

The application integrates a locally hosted Large Language Model (LLM) using Ollama to provide AI-powered ticket classification and chatbot functionality.

## 2. Key Features

### Authentication and Authorization

- User registration and login.
- JWT-based authentication.
- BCrypt password encryption.
- Role-based authorization using Spring Security.
- Roles: CUSTOMER, AGENT, MANAGER, ADMIN.
- Protected REST APIs.

### Ticket Management

- Create, retrieve, update, and delete tickets.
- Track ticket status, category, and priority.
- View tickets created by the logged-in customer.
- Advanced ticket search and filtering.
- Assign tickets to support agents.
- Maintain ticket history and comments.

### AI-Powered Ticket Classification

- Integration with Ollama and Llama 3.2.
- Automatically classify incoming tickets.
- AI-generated category and priority suggestions.
- Store AI classification reason and results.

### Intelligent Agent Assignment

- Recommend suitable agents for tickets.
- Consider agent workload and category expertise.
- Rank recommended agents.
- Support automatic ticket assignment.
- Generate assignment notifications.

### SLA Management

- Priority-based SLA deadlines.
- SLA status tracking.
- Detect SLA breaches automatically.
- Escalate breached tickets.
- Notify managers about SLA breaches.
- Track at-risk, compliant, and breached tickets.

**SLA Policies**

| Priority | Resolution Target |
| -------- | ----------------: |
| CRITICAL |           4 hours |
| HIGH     |           8 hours |
| MEDIUM   |          24 hours |
| LOW      |          48 hours |

### Admin Dashboard and Analytics

- Total ticket statistics.
- Ticket status distribution.
- Priority and category distribution.
- Agent workload monitoring.
- Unassigned ticket tracking.
- Date-range analytics.
- Historical resolution analytics.
- SLA analytics and reporting.

### AI Support Chatbot

- Conversation-aware chatbot.
- Understand ticket-related user intents.
- Create tickets through chatbot interactions.
- Check ticket status.
- List customer tickets.
- Add ticket comments.
- Retrieve relevant knowledge-base information using RAG.

The AI interprets requests, while Spring Boot services handle authentication, authorization, and actual database operations.

### Additional Features

- Ticket history tracking.
- Ticket comments.
- Notification management.
- Global exception handling.
- REST API validation.
- Unit testing with JUnit and Mockito.

