## 6. AI Integration

SupportAI uses **Ollama** to run Llama 3.2 locally.

### AI Ticket Classification

```text
Customer creates ticket
        |
        v
AI Classification Service
        |
        v
Ollama - Llama 3.2
        |
        v
Category / Priority / Reason
        |
        v
Spring Boot Service
        |
        v
Save ticket and AI results in MySQL
```

### AI Chatbot

The chatbot processes user messages and identifies intents such as:

- CREATE_TICKET
- CHECK_TICKET_STATUS
- LIST_MY_TICKETS
- ADD_COMMENT
- UPDATE_TICKET
- UNKNOWN

The chatbot uses conversation context and knowledge-base retrieval to provide relevant responses.

Business operations are performed by the backend services, not directly by the LLM.

